15. With regard to the enhancement of compensation is concerned in para No14 to 17 the tribunal has observed as under:
Issue No.3: PW1 has produced wound certificate at Ex.P4 issued by Yashodhara super Specialty Hospital Solapur and on perusal of the same, the following nature of injuries have been mentioned herein under:
1. Cut lacerated wound forehead about approximately 7- 8 cm x 0.5 cm extending upto parietal region;
2. Cut lacerated wound about approximately 3x2 cm over right maxillary region;
3. Cut lacerated wound over right ear pinna and 4. Swelling over right wrist displaced spiral fracture digital shaft radius.
